#: recaptcha-for-buddypress.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Complete CAPTCHA solution with support for reCAPTCHA v2, v3, Cloudflare "
"Turnstile, hCaptcha, and ALTCHA. Protect WordPress, WooCommerce, "
"BuddyPress, bbPress, and popular form builders from spam and bots with a "
"modular, easy-to-manage interface."
msgstr ""
"Solución completa de CAPTCHA con soporte para reCAPTCHA v2, v3, Cloudflare "
"Turnstile, hCaptcha y ALTCHA. Protege WordPress, WooCommerce, BuddyPress, "
"bbPress y constructores de formularios populares contra spam y bots con una "
"interfaz modular y fácil de administrar."

